 "阿鲁台", "aliases": ["和宁王"], "era": "明", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "阿鲁台受封和宁王。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "fd6d854f-724b-5621-91d3-593e412f448b"}, {"name": "朱高炽", "aliases": ["明仁宗"], "era": "明", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "明仁宗，永樂22年（1424年）八月，朱高炽即皇帝位。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "2dded14d-7183-56b5-9029-ca93826c1e80"}, {"name": "黄淮", "aliases": ["黃淮"], "era": "明", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "明代官员，建文4年（1402年）八月，黄淮以翰林编修身份入直文渊阁。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "e32b0e82-1f00-53e4-bd5e-1b46eecf09ef"}, {"name": "杨溥（明代内阁大学士）", "aliases": ["楊溥"], "era": "明", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "明代官员，洪熙元年（1425年）闰七月，杨溥以太常卿兼翰林学士身份共同处理内阁事务。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "1f1bfa42-5ca4-5450-84a8-f7927b05b3f7"}, {"name": "杨士奇", "aliases": ["楊士奇"], "era": "明", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "明代官员，建文4年（1402年）九月，杨士奇以翰林编修身份入直文渊阁。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "cf93d13f-f48a-5fc6-8687-47933c0ca559"}, {"name": "陈循", "aliases": ["陳循"], "era": "明", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "明代官员，正統9年（1444年）四月，陈循以翰林学士身份入直内阁。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "b5542e79-ef69-5435-9fe8-6c263bd5be96"}, {"name": "郑和", "aliases": ["鄭和"], "era": "明", "birth_year": null, "death_year": null, "description": "明代中官。本纪载其于永乐三年率舟师出使西洋各国。", "biography": null, "status": "draft", "id": "9a24d146-cea1-5746-85e4-479becda6195"}]'::jsonb)
